Maintainer: Egill Fridgeirsson <e.fridgeirsson@erasmusmc.nl>
Description: Implements federated learning workflows for patient-level
    prediction models, including distributed data preparation, model fitting,
    diagnostics, and evaluation across simulated or remote clinical data sites.
